      of log-magnitude mel-scale spectrograms.
    name: An optional name for the operation.
  Returns:
    A `[..., num_mel_bins]` `float32`/`float64` `Tensor` of the MFCCs of
    `log_mel_spectrograms`.

  Raises:
    ValueError: If `num_mel_bins` is not positive.

